{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_TILE_BASED_MANA_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cards by <strong>positioning magic sigils</strong> on the crescent moon. There's <strong>no limit to how many cards you can play,</strong> as long as you have the space! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_SIMPLE_PLACEMENT_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_BUILD_YOUR_DECK_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>three playable characters</strong> and <strong>hundreds of cards</strong> to choose from, there are countless possible decks with a variety of strategies and play styles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_CARDS_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_POSITIONING_MATTERS_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Position your sigils strategically</strong> and get massive bonuses for adjacency, overlap, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_COMBO_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_EVERY_TURN_IS_UNIQUE_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some sigils</strong> <strong>persist on your board</strong> between turns or have <strong>ongoing effects. </strong>Certain enemies will even cast their own <strong>hostile sigils</strong> onto your board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_PLACEMENT_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_MODIFY_YOUR_CARDS_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your cards</strong> and inscribe them<strong> </strong>with <strong>runes of power</strong>. Spread the benefits over your entire deck, or put everything into one or two overpowered cards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_UPGRADE_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_JOURNEY_ACROSS_THE_STARS_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel across the fallen realms and experience visions from beyond. </strong>Choose between mysterious boons, powerful upgrades, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_LIGHTS_1.gif?t=1740190546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our Discord to sign up for a playtest! </strong>We'd love to hear your feedback!</p>","background":"https:/